flowchart TB
    N1["1. neo-riscv-fuzz: Proof/evidence flow shows how a claim becomes checkable."]
    N2["2. Claim: This unit performed: Generate valid scripts | Exercise codecs | Find host/guest mismatches."]
    N3["3. Witness or input: seed corpus | generated opcodes | mutated stack values"]
    N4["4. Execution or check: execute at the PolkaVM and host boundary"]
    N5["5. Public commitment: ABI digest, execution result, gas report, and syscall trace"]
    N6["6. Verifier: RISC-V host | Neo N4 L2 node | developer tooling"]
    N7["7. Accepted result: regression seed | crash case | coverage signal"]
    N8["8. Rejected result: reject ABI, guest fault, or host callback; do not commit state change"]
    N1 --> N2
    N2 --> N3
    N3 --> N4
    N4 --> N5
    N5 --> N6
    N6 --> N7
    N7 --> N8
